'''South Seas Otter''' (南国ラッコ, ''Nangoku Rakko'', '''Southern Land Otter''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Otta-smack-u]] that appears in [[Island Defenders!]]. It was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = South Seas Otter
|image = E 737.png
|first appearance = [[Island Defenders!]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
}}

==Enemy==
An [[Otta-smack-u]] boasting a giant range, alongside a guaranteed [[Slow]] that can reach up to 625 range with its [[Surge Attack#Mini-Surge|Mini-Surge]]. It retains a very fast attack rate, however has three knockbacks unlike Otta-smack-u and moves at half the speed. This enemy is weak initially, but later stages buff it to absurdly high percentages.

==Strategy==
At lower percentages, this enemy is pretty easy to kill even with any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]], since a pretty large stack of [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] are able to outrange its main attack and kill it with relative ease.

However, by stage 4, you should pivot to using more powerful midrangers/backliners such as [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]]/[[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs]]. It is also recommended to utilize [[Long Distance]] crowd-controllers like [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] to prevent hoards of them from pushing, alongside [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]]. If possible any [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] ubers help immensely with this enemy at higher percentages.

