==Trivia==
*South Seas Otter's Japanese name, Nangoku Rakko (南国ラッコ, "Southern Land Otter"), is a combination of 南国 ''nangoku'' (southern land/country; usually has the connotations of a stereotypical tropical paradise), 海獺 ''rakko'' (sea otter) and possibly ''[[Lutrinae Gokurakko|Gokurakko]]''.

